<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle> Between Ascension and San Carlos - The carrier duel, 2018</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0b0080 face=Arial&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0b0080 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;SCENARIO:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Between Ascension and San Carlos&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Falklands war, 1982 - "What if" scenario.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;Argentine Navy was quite powerful by South America standard, but never tried to attack the British lines of communication in the Atlantic between &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "u1" /&gt;&lt;u1:PlaceName u2:st="on"&gt;Ascension&lt;/u1:PlaceName&gt; &lt;u1:PlaceType u2:st="on"&gt;Islands&lt;/u1:PlaceType&gt; and the &lt;u1:place u2:st="on"&gt;Falklands&lt;/u1:place&gt;. This scenario depicts aggressive moves by Argentine task forces, including Venticinco de Mayo carrier, trying to attack escorted Royal Navy replenishment ships, carrying much needed fuel and spares to the British task force to the South. The Royal Navy, discovering the plan, calls the Invincible carrier with escorts and a SSN&amp;nbsp;for help from the South, trying to stop the argentine formation and save the replenishment ships.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Playable from UK only&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
